<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank 1996 net at 2.26 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank 1996 net at 2.26 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co, one of the largest banks in the country, said on Monday unaudited net income rose by about 28 percent to 2.26 billion pesos in 1996 from 1.76 billion pesos in 1995.  </p>
<p>A bank official confirmed a newspaper report on the earnings, adding that profits were mainly boosted by interest income on loans.</p>
<p>For the three months ended December 31, 1996, the bank made a net income of 606.099 million pesos, the official said.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
